{
  "description": "Attach a Bundle to a Slack channel or a Slack workspace. A Bundle attached to a workspace can be used in the workspace and in every channel in it. Attaching a Bundle to a channel or workspace it is already attached to returns the existing Bundle Target. The channel or workspace must be set up: attaching never sets a channel up. A group direct message takes no Bundle and returns 400.",
